msgid ""
"Add the services this listing offers. Each service can have its own title, "
"description, price, duration, status, and photo. Services appear on the "
"listing detail page under the Services tab."
msgstr ""
"Voeg de services toe die deze listing aanbiedt. Elke service kan zijn eigen "
