#: includes/class-features.php:34
msgid ""
"Allow visitors and members to submit new listings from the frontend "
"submission form."
msgstr ""
"Sta bezoekers en leden toe om nieuwe listings in te dienen via het frontend-"
"inzendingsformulier."

#: includes/class-features.php:41
msgid "Reviews & Ratings"
msgstr "Beoordelingen & Waarderingen"

#: includes/class-features.php:42
msgid "Enable star ratings and review submissions on listing detail pages."
msgstr ""
"Schakel sterrenwaarderingen en beoordelingsindieningingen in op pagina's met "
"listingdetails."

#: includes/class-features.php:49
msgid "Business Claims"
msgstr "Zakelijke claims"

#: includes/class-features.php:50
msgid "Allow business owners to claim ownership of unverified listings."
msgstr ""
"Sta bedrijfseigenaren toe eigendom van niet-geverifieerde listings op te "
"eisen."

#: includes/class-features.php:57 includes/class-template-helpers.php:430
#: templates/blocks/user-dashboard/nav.php:164
#: src/blocks/user-dashboard/index.js:35
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "Favorieten"

#: includes/class-features.php:58
msgid "Let logged-in users save listings to a personal favorites list."
msgstr ""
"Sta aangemelde gebruikers toe listings op te slaan in een persoonlijke "
"favoritenlijst."

#: includes/class-features.php:65
msgid "Contact Owner Form"
msgstr "Formulier Contact met eigenaar"

#: includes/class-features.php:66
msgid ""
"Show a form on listing pages that emails the listing owner and saves each "
"message as a lead. Off: no contact form and no new leads, on the site or in "
"the app."
msgstr "Toon op vermeldingspagina's een formulier dat de eigenaar van de vermelding mailt en elk bericht als lead opslaat. Uit: geen contactformulier en geen nieuwe leads, op de site of in de app."

#: includes/class-features.php:73
msgid "Listing Renewal"
msgstr "Listingvernieuwing"

#: includes/class-features.php:74
msgid "Allow listing owners to renew expired listings from their dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Sta listingeigenaren toe verlopen listings van hun dashboard te vernieuwen."

#: includes/class-features.php:81
msgid "Show Who Listed It"
msgstr "Toon wie de vermelding heeft geplaatst"

#: includes/class-features.php:82
msgid ""
"Show a \"Listed by\" name on listing pages, the way Google Maps, Yelp and "
"TripAdvisor do. Uses the listing's public contact name, or the account "
"display name when there is none. Off: listings show no name anywhere, site "
"or app."
msgstr "Toon op vermeldingspagina's een naam bij \"Geplaatst door\", zoals Google Maps, Yelp en TripAdvisor doen. Gebruikt de openbare contactnaam van de vermelding, of de weergavenaam van het account als die er niet is. Uit: vermeldingen tonen nergens een naam, op de site of in de app."

#: includes/class-features.php:89
msgid "Report Listings"
msgstr "Listings rapporteren"

#: includes/class-features.php:90
msgid ""
"Let visitors flag inaccurate, spam, closed, or inappropriate listings for "
"admin review."
msgstr ""
"Sta bezoekers toe onjuiste, spam-, gesloten of ongepaste listings voor "
"beheerderscontrole aan te vlaggen."

#: includes/class-features.php:98
msgid "Schema.org JSON-LD"
msgstr "Schema.org JSON-LD"

#: includes/class-features.php:99
msgid ""
"Output structured data on listing pages (LocalBusiness, AggregateRating, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Voer gestructureerde gegevens uit op listingpagina's (LocalBusiness, "
"AggregateRating, enz.)."

#: includes/class-features.php:106
msgid "Open Graph + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "Open Graph + Twitter Cards"

#: includes/class-features.php:107
msgid ""
"Generate social sharing meta tags so listings preview nicely on Facebook, "
"Twitter/X, LinkedIn."
msgstr ""
"Genereer meta-tags voor sociale media zodat listings mooi worden weergegeven "
"op Facebook, Twitter/X, LinkedIn."

#: includes/class-features.php:114
msgid "Breadcrumbs"
msgstr "Breadcrumbs"

#: includes/class-features.php:115
msgid ""
"Show breadcrumb navigation on listing detail pages with BreadcrumbList "
"schema."
msgstr ""
"Toon breadcrumb-navigatie op listingdetailpagina's met BreadcrumbList-schema."

#: includes/class-features.php:122
msgid "Sitemap (XML)"
msgstr "Sitemap (XML)"

#: includes/class-features.php:123
msgid "Add listings to the XML sitemap so search engines can discover them."
msgstr ""
"Voeg listings toe aan de XML-sitemap zodat zoekmachines ze kunnen ontdekken."

